CONTRIBUTIONS
================================================================================

Contributions to this project are welcome and encouraged. The following process
applies to all contributions:

  1. SUBMISSION
     Contributions must be submitted as Pull Requests through the official
     project repository. Direct commits to the main branch are not permitted
     for external contributors.

  2. REVIEW
     All submitted Pull Requests are reviewed by the project maintainers
     (Muhammad Imtinan ul Haq and Abdullah Ahmad Khan) before being merged.
     Maintainers may request changes, ask for clarification, or decline a
     contribution at their discretion.

  3. OWNERSHIP OF CONTRIBUTIONS
     By submitting a contribution, you confirm that:
       a. You have the right to submit the code or content.
       b. You agree that your contribution will be governed by this license.
       c. You grant the original authors a perpetual, irrevocable, worldwide,
          royalty-free license to use, reproduce, modify, and distribute your
          contribution as part of this project.

  4. CONTRIBUTOR CREDIT
     Contributors whose submissions are accepted and merged will be credited
     in the project's contributor acknowledgments. This does not transfer
     copyright ownership or grant maintainer status.

  5. CONDUCT
     All contributors are expected to engage respectfully. Submissions that
     introduce malicious code, violate third-party licenses, or violate the
     conduct expectations of the project will be rejected.

